<h3>SPHEREx Science Tools</h3>
<table class="mission">
<tr class="top">
    <th><a href="/applications/spherex/tool-spectrophotometry">Spectrophotometry Tool</a></th>
    <td>
        Extract spectra from SPHEREx Spectral Images using forced photometry. Read the <a href="/onlinehelp/spherex/#sp">Spectrophotometry Tool documentation</a> for detailed usage instructions, inputs, and outputs.
    </td>
</tr>
<tr class="top">
    <th><a href="/applications/spherex/tool-mosaic">Mosaic Tool</a></th>
    <td>
        Create custom multiwavelength mosaics from SPHEREx Spectral Images.
    </td>
</tr>
<tr class="top">
    <th><a href="/data/SPHEREx/docs/cutout_tool.html">Cutout Tool</a></th>
    <td>
        Extract spatial subsets from SPHEREx Spectral Image Multi-Extension FITS files.
    </td>
</tr>
<tr class="top">
    <th><a href="https://caltech-ipac.github.io/irsa-tutorials/spherex-source-discovery-tool-demo/">Source Discovery Tool</a></th>
    <td>
Identify and characterize significant detected sources within a user defined region using SPHEREx data alone, without requiring positional priors.
    </td>
</tr>
</table>

